er to Mirage to hold the kids hostage...",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.25,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","mirage_street_2_daylight",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["show","avg1_136","a","004",null,-0.2,1.2,0,null,1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",0,0],["se","se_282"],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",1,0],["say","avg1_136","With so little time, I'm not absolutely certain that I can end you. Our battle would inevitably reduce Mirage to ruins, with heavy casualties on both sides.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_515"],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,0.65,-0.3,1.32,null,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["obj","qstory_main_07_019",1,0.45,null],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","a","003","music",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_136","Therefore, I am asking you to end your own life with this Scepter of Death. In return, I will guarantee the safety of your companions and the people of Mirage.",0,""],["w",1.0],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.2],["w",0.2],["objx"],["w",0.5],["bg","carriage_inside_a",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["show","avg1_136","a","002",0.4,null,null,0,null,1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",0,0],["se","se_231"],["show","avg3_100","a","002",1.0,-1.0,3.0,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_100","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.2],["w",0.7],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",1,0],["stg",0,-100.0,-100.0,1.1,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,"still"],["ctl","avg1_136","a","002","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_136","From the very beginning, the only person I've wanted to kill is the Tyrant.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_226"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",0,0],["ctl","avg1_136","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",1,0],["ctl","avg1_136","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_136","That's exactly why I tried to ambush ==SEX4== in Philae.==W== This way,==W== the only casualties would have been just the two of us.==W== Don't you agree that would have been far better than letting the flames of war consume Mirage?",0,""],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,"happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.7],["goon"],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_136","a","009","star",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.2],["w",0.2],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","mirage_street_2_daylight",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["se","se_282"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",0,0],["show","avg1_136","a","002",0.5,0.0,1.0,0,null,1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.2],["w",0.7],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",1,0],["say","avg1_136","Even if they spare me for now, in four years, when the world is truly safe from destruction, I will ask them to take my life as recompense for yours.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_483"],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,null,-0.25,1.3,null,null,"OutQuad",0.0],["say","avg1_136","In other words, no matter what happens, I will pay for your life with my own. If you still doubt me, your companions can bind me with a magical contract. An unbreakable one.",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","mirage_street_2_daylight",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.2,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg3_217","a","012",0.35,null,0.9,0,null,1.0],["show","avg1_139","a","006",0.7,null,1.0,0,null,1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",0,0],["se","se_231"],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.2],["w",0.7],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",1,0],["ctl","avg3_217","a","012",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_217","Out of my way. I'm not here to hurt you or the kids. I just want the Tyrant.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",1,0],["bg","mine_inside_2",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,2],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bgm","m79"],["show","avg1_139","a","024",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_139","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","They won't. I can't explain how I know this, but the Salvation Committee only cares about one thing: kill the Tyrant and save the world.",1,""],["ctl","avg1_139","a","013",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",1.0],["mrt",0,"z","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","If I ran anywhere else, they might resort to dirty tactics to flush me out.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","012","exclamation",null],["say","avg3_100","But the ruined Monolith is different. The entrance isn't some randomized elevator. It's a single, gaping hole in the wall.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","013","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","If they block that hole, they trap me. Once Angie's got me cornered, they have zero reason to waste time on the orphanage or Mirage.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_139","a","007","question",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_139","You're using yourself as bait to protect the orphanage?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_139","a","022","exclamation",null,-0.4,1.5,null,null,"OutCubic",0.3],["say","avg1_139","No! I can't just stand by and watch you sacrifice yourself. Let me hold off the Committee while you evacuate the kids.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","023",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Don't worry, Allie. Things aren't that grim.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_139","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.0],["bg","forest",3,0.0],["show","avg1_149","a","002",0.45,0.2,0.8,3,null,1.0],["show","avg1_110","c","002",0.55,-0.1,0.9,3,null,1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_544"],["stage",3,0,0],["mrt",2,"z","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","First, reinforcements from Firenze and the Dusk Arbiters are already en route. They will reach Mirage in three days. Time is on our side.",1,""],["w",0.5],["bg","tower_elevator_close",4,0.0],["cbg",4,400.0,-100.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["se","se_545"],["stage",4,0,0],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Second, you still have to use the elevator to move between floors. Strict weight limits, randomized drop-offs. It's the perfect chokepoint to divide their forces and pick them off.",1,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_546"],["bg","mood_3",0,0.5],["show","avg3_216","a","007",0.5,-0.05,0.9,0,null,null],["show","avg3_217","a","004",0.63,0.15,0.9,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_163","a","002",0.37,0.15,0.9,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_216","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_217","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_163","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Finally, the Committee is a patchwork of Sentinels of Dawn, Imperial Guards, Dusk Arbiters, and corporate mercs. They might have raw magic, but they have zero experience climbing a Monolith together.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.505],["w",0.505],["stage",3,1,1],["stage",4,1,1],["bg","mine_inside_2",0,0.0],["stg",0,-180.0,null,1.2,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,null,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_139","a","024",0.55,-0.25,1.3,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_139","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","013","music",null],["say","avg3_100","To borrow a phrase from the Loong, we hold the advantage in timing, terrain, and teamwork. There's nothing to worry about. We are going to win.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,200.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_139","a","029",null,0.7,null,null,null,nu